'''Summer Break Cats''' (ねこのなつやすみ, ''Neko no Natsuyasumi'', '''Cats' Summer Vacation''') is an event added in the [[Version 10.7 Update]]. Like all [[Gauntlet]]s, progress made in Summer Break Cats will reset when the event ends. The bosses of this Gauntlet are many common enemies that the player encounters during main progress.

==Overview==
Summer Break Cats contains a total of 20 stages. After beating 3 stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for each stage completion are Legend Nets.

