==Trivia==
*Summer Break Cats' Japanese name, Neko no Natsuyasumi (ねこのなつやすみ, "Cats' Summer Vacation"), may be a reference to the game ''[[wikipedia:Boku no Natsuyasumi|Boku no Natsuyasumi]]''. The [[Media:Summerbreakcatsen.png|original event banner]] also looks similar to ''Boku no Natsuyasumi''<nowiki />'s box art.
*Summer Break Cats is currently the only [[Gauntlet]] to use collab enemies outside of a collaboration.

